Good day.                    {proper, polite}
Yo.                          {crude, lighthearted}
Oi.                          {crude+}
Hey, you.                    {rude}
[taught_greeting]!           {w=3}
[taught_greeting], [listener]! {w=3}
Ugh, you.                    {rude+}
Morning.                     {time=morning}
Good morning!                {time=morning, optimist}
Evening.                     {time=evening}
You're up late.              {time=night}
...Hm.                       {introvert+}

