You know what you are? [taught_describe.cap]. {opinion=friend, w=1.5}
Been [taught_activity] lately? {w=1.5}
I spent all morning [taught_activity]. Best morning in ages. {w=1}
When I grow up I'm gonna be the strongest person ever. {age=child, w=6}
