# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Trying to talk to them mid-fight, or when they're out to get you. fighting_you=yes when you're who they're
# fighting; in_combat=no means they're hostile but not fighting yet (say, you're in creative).

== busy_fighting ==
Not now!
Kind of busy here!
Can't talk!
Later!
Not now, [listener]! Help me!  {relation=ally, w=3}
Wait your turn!              {brawling=yes, fighting_you=no, w=4}
This is between me and them. {brawling=yes, fighting_you=no, w=4}
Talking won't save you. Fists up! {brawling=yes, fighting_you=yes, w=6}
Less talking, more punching! {brawling=yes, fighting_you=yes, lighthearted, w=6}
Grab a weapon, [listener]!   {relation=ally, w=3}
Talk later, fight now!       {relation=ally, brave, w=3}
I'm a little busy not dying!  {relation=ally, lighthearted, w=3}
Can't you see I'm fighting?! {rude, w=2}
Not now, damn it!            {crude, w=3}
Are you serious right now?   {lighthearted, w=2}
Pardon me, I'm rather occupied. {proper, polite, w=3}
Help! Please!                {timid, w=3}
Run! Why are you standing there?! {timid, relation=ally, w=3}
Cube God, give me strength! {pious, w=2}
You want to talk? Talk to my fist! {fighting_you=yes, hothead, w=4}
Talk? Ha! Not a chance. {fighting_you=yes, w=4}
Oh, NOW you want to chat? {fighting_you=yes, lighthearted, w=4}
I've got nothing to say to you. {fighting_you=yes, w=4}
Nice try. Die.               {fighting_you=yes, rude, w=4}
Go to hell!                  {fighting_you=yes, crude, w=5}
Nothing personal. Well. A little personal. {fighting_you=yes, has_faction=yes, w=3}
For the [faction]!           {fighting_you=yes, has_faction=yes, brave, w=3}
The [faction] don't talk to your kind. {relation=hostile, has_faction=yes, w=4}
I don't talk to your kind.   {relation=hostile, w=3}
Get away from me.            {relation=hostile, w=3}
Get lost before I change my mind. {relation=hostile, in_combat=no, w=4}
You're lucky I'm in a good mood. {relation=hostile, in_combat=no, mood=great, w=4}
Back off.                    {relation=hostile, in_combat=no, w=3}
Piss off.                    {relation=hostile, crude, w=5}
I know what you did.         {relation=hostile, opinion=enemy, vengeful, w=5}

