Ugh. Fine.                   {rude}
Hm.                          {taciturn, w=2}
That's a big question.       {serious}
I'm an open book. A short one. {lighthearted}

== where_from ==
[home_biome.the.cap]. Born and raised. {w=3}
[home_biome.the.cap]. You can probably tell. {w=2}
I'm from [home_biome.the]. {w=3}
[home_biome.the.cap]. Best place there is. {biome_like=like, at_home=yes, w=2}
Right here! [home_biome.the.cap], born and raised. {at_home=yes, w=4}
You're standing in it. [home_biome.the.cap]. {at_home=yes, lighthearted, w=3}
Here. Never been anywhere else, really. {at_home=yes, introvert, w=3}
Oh, [home_biome.the]! I could talk about it for hours. Don't worry, I won't. {extrovert, w=2}
[home_biome.the.cap]. Why? {paranoid, w=3}
Why do you want to know? {paranoid, w=1}
[home_biome.the.cap]. Not that it's any of your business. {rude, w=3}
[home_biome.the.cap].        {taciturn, w=4}
[home_biome.the.cap]. Cold enough to freeze the words in your mouth. {home_climate=cold, w=3}
[home_biome.the.cap]. You learn to love snow, or you leave. {home_climate=cold, w=2}
[home_biome.the.cap]. You learn to love the heat, or you leave. {home_climate=hot, w=2}
[home_biome.the.cap]. Hot as hell and twice as dry. {home_climate=hot, crude, w=3}
[home_biome.the.cap]. Not much to say about it. It's nice. {home_climate=mild, w=2}
[home_biome.the.cap]. Haven't been back in a long time. {at_home=no, serious, w=2}
[home_biome.the.cap]. I miss it. {at_home=no, w=2}
[home_biome.the.cap]. I don't miss it. {at_home=no, pessimist, w=2}
Around. Here and there.
I'd rather not say.          {taciturn}

== ask_about_who ==
Who?
Who do you mean?
About who?
Ooh. Who?                    {nosy, w=3}
Gossip? I'm listening.       {nosy, w=2}
I don't talk about people behind their backs. {honest, w=2}
Careful what you ask, [listener]. {paranoid}

== opinion_of_you ==
You? You're all right.       {opinion=neutral}
I don't really know you yet. {opinion=neutral}
Honestly? Haven't made my mind up. {opinion=neutral, honest}
I like you, [listener].      {opinion=friendly}
I enjoy having you around.   {opinion=friendly}
You're a friend. A real one. {opinion=friend}
I'd trust you with my life.  {opinion=close_friend}
You're the best friend I've got, [listener]. {opinion=close_friend, w=2}
Honestly? Not much.          {opinion=disliked}
You really want to know? No. {opinion=disliked, rude}
I'd rather not say.          {opinion=disliked, polite}
I can't stand you.           {opinion=enemy}
Get out of my sight.         {opinion=enemy, rude}
You know exactly what I think of you. {opinion=enemy, vengeful}
I think you're wonderful. Don't let it go to your head. {opinion=close_friend, lighthearted}
Do you really need me to say it? {opinion=friend, introvert}

== opinion_of ==
[other]? Don't know much about them.     {about=neutral}
[other]? They're all right.              {about=neutral}
[other]? Haven't made up my mind.        {about=neutral}
