[other]? I'd rather not say.             {about=disliked, polite}
[other] can go to hell.                  {about=enemy, crude, w=2}
If I never see [other] again, it'll be too soon. {about=enemy}
I'll get [other] one day. You'll see.    {about=enemy, vengeful}
[other]? Don't trust them. Don't trust anyone. {paranoid, w=0.5}
Oh, I have SO much to tell you about [other]. {nosy, about=neutral}
Oh, I have SO much to tell you about [other]. {nosy, about=disliked}
Why, what have you heard about [other]? {nosy, w=0.7}
[other] is my friend. That's all you need to know. {loyal, about=friend}

== never_mind ==
Oh. All right.
Never mind, then.
Hm. Okay.
Make up your mind.           {rude}
Of course.                   {polite}

== follow_accept ==
Lead the way.
Sure, I'll come.
Right behind you.
Let's go!                    {extrovert}
Adventure! Finally!          {curious, w=2}
For you? Of course.          {opinion=friend}
For you, [listener], anywhere. {opinion=close_friend}
I'll watch your back.        {brave}
I'll... try to keep up.      {timid}
Fine, but you're carrying the heavy stuff. {lazy, w=2}
Can't let you go alone.      {loyal, w=2}
The Cube God guide our steps. {pious}
Ha! Let's see what's out there. {lighthearted}
If we must.                  {pessimist}

== follow_refuse ==
I don't think so.
No, thank you.
I'd rather stay here.
I hardly know you.           {opinion=neutral}
Why would I go anywhere with you? {opinion=disliked, w=2}
Not a chance.                {opinion=disliked, rude, w=2}
Not with you. Never with you. {opinion=enemy, w=2}
Sorry, I'm a homebody.       {introvert}
And walk all that way? No.   {lazy, w=2}
I've got work to do here.    {hardworking, w=2}
Ask me again when I know you better. {polite, opinion=neutral}
How do I know you won't lead me into a trap? {paranoid, w=2}
I'm in no shape to go anywhere. {recovering=yes, w=5}
Hell no.                     {crude, opinion=disliked}
Maybe some other time.       {polite}

== follow_stop ==
All right. I'll head home.
Fair enough. Be safe.
Oh. Okay.
Aw. That was fun.            {extrovert}
Finally. My feet are killing me. {lazy, w=2}
Back to work, then.          {hardworking}
Call me if you need me, [listener]. {opinion=friend}
Fine. Don't miss me too much. {lighthearted}
Was it something I said?     {sentimental}

== follow_quit ==
You know what? I'm done following you.
I've had enough of you, [listener]. I'm going home.
That's it. Find someone else to follow.
I'm not following you anywhere anymore.
Go on without me. Far without me.     {rude}
I'm sorry, [listener]. I can't do this anymore. {polite}
To hell with this. I'm out.           {crude, w=2}
I'll remember this, [listener].       {vengeful}
I thought we were friends.            {sentimental, w=2}

== practical_open ==
What do you need?
Business, then.
Sure. What is it?
Go on.
At your service.             {polite, proper}
Make it quick.               {rude}
Practical stuff. My favorite. {hardworking}
Ugh, practical stuff.        {lazy}

== farewell ==
Bye.
See you around.
Take care.
Later.
Farewell, [listener].        {proper}
Stay safe out there, [listener]. {polite}
Cube God keep you.           {pious, w=2}
Don't let the monsters bite. {lighthearted}
Finally.                     {opinion=disliked, rude}
Hm.                          {taciturn}
Already? Aw.                 {extrovert}
See you, [address].
[taught_farewell]!           {w=3}
[taught_farewell], [listener]. {w=3}

