I had a whole speech. I forgot it. Will you marry me? {lighthearted, w=3}
The Cube God brought us together. Will you marry me? {pious, w=3}

== player_said_yes ==
[taught_happy]! Really?        {w=4}
Really? Oh, that's wonderful!
You mean it? I'm so happy!
Yes! I mean, good. That's good. Yes.  {introvert, w=3}
I knew it!                   {proud, w=3}
This is the best day ever!   {extrovert, w=3}

== player_accepted_proposal ==
We're getting married! We're actually getting married!
You said yes! You said yes!
I'm the luckiest person alive.
Cube God be praised!         {pious, w=3}

== player_said_no ==
[taught_sad]. Okay.            {w=4}
Oh. I see.
I... understand. Sorry I asked.
Right. Forget I said anything.
Oh. Well. That's that, then. {pessimist, w=3}
Your loss.                   {proud, w=4}
Your loss.                   {rude, w=3}
I'll get over it. Probably.  {lighthearted, w=3}

== player_wants_time ==
Take your time. I'll be here.
Of course. Think it over.
Don't take too long, all right? {rude, w=3}
I'll wait. I'm good at waiting. {zen, w=3}

== ask_out_taken ==
I'm seeing [partner], actually.
Sorry. I'm with [partner].
I'm with [partner]. You know that. {rude, w=3}
Oh! I'm flattered, but [partner] wouldn't like that. {polite, w=3}

== ask_out_you_are_taken ==
Aren't you with [partner]?
What would [partner] say?
Don't you already have [partner]? {rude, w=3}
I'm not getting in between you and [partner]. {honest, w=3}
Oh, I'm telling [partner] about this. {nosy, w=4}

== ask_out_not_yet ==
I like you, but... not like that. Not yet, anyway.
Let's get to know each other better first.
You're sweet. Ask me again some other time?
Ha! Buy me a few more gifts first. {greedy, w=3}
Ha! Nice try.                {lighthearted, w=3}
No.                          {opinion=neutral, rude, w=3}

== about_us ==
Yes, love?
What is it?
Us? What about us?
Is everything all right?     {timid, w=3}
Uh oh. That sounds serious.  {lighthearted, w=3}

== proposal_too_soon ==
It's... a little soon, isn't it?
Slow down! We've only just started seeing each other.
Ask me again when we've been together a while.
I love that you asked. But not yet. {romantic, w=3}

== proposal_yes ==
Yes! Of course, yes!
Yes. Yes, yes, yes!
I'd be honored.              {proper, w=3}
I thought you'd never ask!   {romantic, w=3}

== wedding_too_soon ==
Soon. Let's not rush it.
We've only just gotten engaged. Let's enjoy it a little.
Not yet. I want it to be perfect. {proud, w=3}

== wedding_day ==
I can't believe it. We're married!
Married. To you. I'm so happy.
This is the best day of my life.
Cube God bless us both.      {pious, w=3}
Til death do us part. Well, maybe not death, but you know. {lighthearted, w=3}

