...I see.
What? Why?
I thought... never mind what I thought.
Fine. Go, then.              {rude, w=3}
I'll remember this.          {vengeful, w=3}
I hope you find what you're looking for. {forgiving, w=3}
*sniff* Okay.                {sentimental, w=3}

== divorce_heard ==
