...If that's what you want.
I never want to see you again. {vengeful, w=3}
I hope you're happy.         {rude, w=3}

== no_family ==
No family to speak of. Just me.
It's just me, I'm afraid.
Never had much family. That's fine.
Family? Haven't found mine yet. {romantic, w=3}

