# Children. [baby] is the newborn's name; baby_gender is male or female.

== new_baby ==
It's here! Our baby is here! Meet [baby]!
We have a baby! [baby]. Isn't [baby] perfect?
Everyone, meet [baby]!
It's a girl! We're calling her [baby]. {baby_gender=female, w=4}
It's a boy! We're calling him [baby]. {baby_gender=male, w=4}
Cube God, thank you for [baby]. {pious, w=4}
I'm a parent. Me! A parent!  {extrovert, w=3}
Oh, [baby]. Look at those tiny hands. {sentimental, w=4}

